          "abridged": false,
          "description": "Get ready for four hilarious and heartwarming tales from Jory John and Pete Oswald’s bestselling Food Group series, where each story serves up big laughs and even bigger lessons about kindness, confidence, and staying true to yourself.  \n\nIn The Cool Bean, an uncool has-bean learns that being cool isn’t about swagger or shades—it’s about being kind and being yourself. The Smart Cookie shows that feeling smart isn’t about getting everything right, but about finding your strengths and believing in yourself. The Sour Grape learns that holding grudges keeps you sour, but forgiveness and compassion can turn your day sweet. And in The Big Cheese, the best-at-everything cheese discovers a slice of humility when a quiet newcomer wins the Cheese-cathlon, learning there’s more to life than always being number one.  \n\nThese witty, charming stories are perfect for kids who love humor with a side of heart—and lessons they’ll carry long after story time ends.  \n\nThis collection includes:  \nThe Cool Bean  \nThe Smart Cookie  \nThe Sour Grape  \nThe Big Cheese",
